.Dd August 7, 2026
.Dt XPT.TREE 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xpt.tree
.Nd package file listing format
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a plain text file listing the files installed by an
.Xr xpt 8
package, one path per line.
.Pp
.Nm
.Xr xpt 8
reads
.Nm
and records its paths in the package database,
mapping each file to its owning package.
blank files are ignored
.Pp
example:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
usr/bin/foo
usr/share/man/man1/foo.1.gz
etc/foo.conf
.Ed
.Pp
.Nm
is generated by
.Xr ebs 1
as part of building an
.Xr xpt 8
package alongside
.Xr xpt.manifest 5
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ebs 1 ,
.Xr mkfhs 1 ,
.Xr rig 1 ,
.Xr libxpt 3 ,
.Xr ebs 5 ,
.Xr xpt.index 5 ,
.Xr xpt.manifest 5 ,
.Xr ecw 8 ,
.Xr xpt 8
